{"text": "Old Koskoosh, who had once been a great hunter and the chief of his tribe, sat by a small fire and listened greedily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His eyes had grown dim long ago, but his hearing was still sharp, and every sound told him what was happening. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was the sound of his own tribe breaking camp, for they were going on a long journey without him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He heard Sit cum to ha, his sons daughter, shouting at the dogs and pushing them into their harnesses. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He heard his sons voice ordering the women to hurry, and the medicine man grunting as he loaded the last tent onto a sled. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Somewhere a child was crying, and Koskoosh thought that little Koo tee, who was weak and often sick, might not live long. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The tribe had to move quickly, because the winter day was short and the long trail would not wait. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Koskoosh did not blame them, for he knew that an old man who could not keep up would only slow the whole tribe down. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had lived his life, and it was the young, not the old, who needed the food and the strength now.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "l", "d", " ", "K", "o", "s", "k", "o", "o", "s", "h", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "o", "n", "c", "e", " ", "b", "e", "e", "n", " ", "a", " ", "g", "r", "e", "a", "t", " ", "h", "u", "n", "t", "e", "r", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "h", "i", "e", "f", " ", "o", "f", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "t", "r", "i", "b", "e", ",", " ", "s", "a", "t", " ", "b", "y", " ", "a", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "f", "i", "r", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "l", "i", "s", "t", "e", "n", "e", "d", " ", "g", "r", "e", "e", "d", "i", "l", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "i", "s", " ", "e", "y", "e", "s", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "g", "r